{"nodes":[{"id":"core","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":220,"text":"# 十元发散引擎\n\n不是十元分类器，也不是仓库抽卡器。\n\n核心：任意对象/问题 → 锁定问题 → 找变量 → 单十元深发散 → 十元横向扫描 → 多十元组合 → 验证收束 → 创作输出"},{"id":"rule","type":"text","x":0,"y":-330,"width":420,"height":240,"text":"## Canvas 权限\n- 这是可视化工作台，不是理论正本\n- current canonical 永远高于 Canvas\n- 不得由职业/身份/情绪/颜色/题材/单名词倒推十元\n- mapping 只作案例、证据、边界校验与具象参考\n- 自动任务只镜像真实进展，不制造假节点"},{"id":"input","type":"text","x":-900,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 入口\n任意对象 / 题材 / 故事 / 创作卡点 / 问题\n\n例：\n“一个想成为偶像的少女”\n“这个故事太普通”\n“这个关系没有戏”"},{"id":"lock_problem","type":"text","x":-520,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 1｜锁定问题\n先问：到底哪里有问题？\n\n身份 / 目标 / 路径 / 关系 / 冲突 / 代价 / 结局 / 机制……\n\n不急着调用十元。"},{"id":"find_variable","type":"text","x":-520,"y":280,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 2｜变量发现\n把“普通/没戏/卡住”改写成可改变变量。\n\n输出：\n- object_layer\n- current state\n- changed_variable candidate\n- 可观测结果"},{"id":"single_deep","type":"text","x":560,"y":-180,"width":360,"height":230,"text":"# A｜单十元深发散\n一个十元自己长树。\n\n每元至少维护：\n1. 核心变量\n2. 发现问题\n3. 母级变换动作\n4. 子级分叉问题\n5. 继续发散规则\n6. 停止条件\n7. 邻居排除\n8. 反例\n9. 可组合接口"},{"id":"horizontal","type":"text","x":560,"y":120,"width":360,"height":190,"text":"# B｜十元横向扫描\n同一个问题同时交给十个十元寻找不同变量。\n\n目标不是判断“它属于谁”，而是发现：\n同一对象还能从哪些结构方向被改写？"},{"id":"combine","type":"text","x":560,"y":380,"width":360,"height":240,"text":"# C｜双/三十元交叉\n把已经独立成立的分支重新组合。\n\n必须保留各自 responsibility / relation_source。\n禁止 percent / weight / ratio。\n组合要产生新结构，不是把两个标签粘一起。\n\n新增硬门：same characters / same window / same broad relation label 都不够，必须核对 same object + same changed_variable。"},{"id":"verify","type":"text","x":560,"y":650,"width":360,"height":300,"text":"# D｜验证与收束\n- nearest neighbor\n- removal test\n- reverse test\n- counterexample\n- same-object-layer / changed-variable gate\n- endpoint attribution / competing-purpose anchor\n- ordinary self-agency ≠ x\n- protection success ≠ subject-specific protected-range x\n- 是否只是题材/名词换皮\n- 是否真正改变结构\n- 是否能继续长树\n\n收束成少量高价值方案。"},{"id":"outputs","type":"text","x":1040,"y":380,"width":320,"height":220,"text":"## 应用输出\n十元发散引擎不是只服务角色。\n\n可落地为：\n角色 / 故事 / 题材 / 世界观 / 关系 / 场景 / 游戏机制 / 镜头 / 创作卡点解决"},{"id":"zx","type":"text","x":-980,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zx｜方向权发散\n发现：哪里存在最终方向由主体生成、夺取、扩大或公开反推？\n\n待扩：母变换动作 / 子分叉 / 纯 zx 边界"},{"id":"nx","type":"text","x":-640,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### nx｜外置通道发散\n发现：哪里已有外部方向、权限或通道，主体如何接入、续接、借力？\n\n待扩：任务 / 权限 / 位置 / 网络 / 改题权"},{"id":"zn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zn｜原则未来调用发散\n发现：什么在身份、收益、环境改变后，仍有资格进入未来判断？\n\n待扩：跨阶段 / 修订 / 利益冲突 / 身份变化"},{"id":"x","type":"text","x":40,"y":930,"width":300,"height":280,"text":"### x｜处置权发散\n发现：什么对象/资源真正归谁处置？\n\n当前发散候选维度需按正本边界校验：scope / permission / revocability / final decision / execution。\n\n已新增：scope/path-set 候选 + protected-range topology/window 动态分支。\n新增 strict-v2 护栏：保护结果成功 ≠ subject-specific protected-range x；ordinary self-agency ≠ x；独立用途/排序 anchor 可阻断 strict zn↔x。\n\n均不自动升级 canonical。"},{"id":"n","type":"text","x":-980,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### n｜内部承载发散\n发现：什么进入之后，被内部真实、持续地承载？\n\n待扩：准入 / 负荷 / 压力 / 重复进入 / 异质协调"},{"id":"x_parallel_z","type":"text","x":-640,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### x并z｜对外接口发散\n发现：什么内部结构形成稳定公共壳/对外接口？\n\n待按 current canonical 继续建立发散操作，禁止靠“公开感”倒推。"},{"id":"xn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### xn｜运行组织发散\n发现：什么运行过程正在组织时间、流程、阶段与执行？\n\n待扩：流程重组 / 节点 / 时序 / 调度 / 执行结构"},{"id":"z","type":"text","x":40,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### z｜确认发散\n发现：什么对象被谁明确看见、回应、确认和采用？\n\n当前应用映射仍有 pending-review 债务，Canvas 不替 canonical 裁决。"},{"id":"xz","type":"text","x":380,"y":930,"width":300,"height":210,"text":"### xz｜未来关闭发散\n发现：哪些未来回头路正在关闭？\n\n母分支示例：\n时间窗口 / 资格窗口 / 路径减少 / 代价上升 / 单次选择锁死 / 信息错位 / 外部封路 / 历史选择反噬"},{"id":"nz","type":"text","x":720,"y":930,"width":300,"height":240,"text":"### nz｜回返修复发散\n发现：哪些对象特异关系/位置，在离开或受损后仍保留真实回返、修复、重新接近路径？\n\n已出现可执行母分支：冲突修复型 nz。\n核心不是“舍不得”，而是关系在断开后仍保有现实可调用的 bilateral reentry + repair。"},{"id":"automation_protocol","type":"text","x":1510,"y":-220,"width":430,"height":330,"text":"# 自动任务 → Canvas 镜像协议\n每次自动任务只有出现真实进展才扩展 Canvas。\n\n每轮可视节点至少记录：\n- 任务名 / 时间\n- 本轮真正解决的问题\n- 新发现变量\n- 新增/修正的发散分支\n- 组合或验证结果\n- rejected / nearest-neighbor 结论\n- 实际修改文件\n- commit SHA\n- 下一断点\n\n禁止只写“继续推进”。无真实变化不制造进展节点。"},{"id":"runlog","type":"text","x":1510,"y":200,"width":430,"height":300,"text":"# 自动任务运行轨迹区\n\n当前方向切换：\n“生成器/映射抽卡”降为应用层；研发中心改为“十元变量发现 + 单十元深发散 + 横向扫描 + 多元组合 + 验证收束”。\n\n起始 main：912499679248faedba74762cbe8692a85f836546\n最新已镜像源：b72be3da7ec768459aab21f795059ec931d501f6"},{"id":"assets","type":"text","x":1040,"y":690,"width":320,"height":280,"text":"## 现有资产的新位置\ncanonical = 边界\nevidence = 成立证据\nmapping = 案例/参考/校验\n64题材库 = 落地空间\n角色生成器 = 一个应用端\nCanvas = 研发可视化镜像\n\n应用端硬门：trigger registry 与 compiler token/version 必须一致，否则 fail closed。\n新增：resolved_request 的 locked/reroll modules 必须归一、去重、固定顺序，语义等价请求应复现同一 provenance。"},{"id":"x_scope_pending_20260905","type":"text","x":380,"y":1210,"width":460,"height":430,"text":"## x｜scope / path-set 发散候选（L4 pending-review）\n来源：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n状态：pending-review，禁止覆盖 canonical\n\nchanged_variable 候选：object/object layer、permission_type、scope、term/revocability/return obligation、final decision/execution topology、override/veto/co-decision、actor-indexed path-set、actuator/target-effect layer、surviving path count、scope/permission transition。\n\n护栏：窄 scope 成立 ≠ 宽 scope 自动成立；宽 scope 不成立 ≠ 窄 current x 自动为假；same actor + same higher-level target effect ≠ same x execution-object path set。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","type":"text","x":1510,"y":570,"width":520,"height":390,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x-scope pending-review 镜像\n来源 commit：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n解决：把 x scope/path-set 研究转译为单十元 x 可发散变量，保持 pending-review。\n新变量：object layer / permission type / scope / term / revocability / decision topology / execution path-set / transition。\n拒绝：formal authority、单次 compliance、接口持有、ownership 标签直接升级完整 x。\n下一断点：其它单十元可执行发散语法；等待 canonical 裁决。"},{"id":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1210,"width":500,"height":500,"text":"## nz｜冲突修复型回返发散（L4 evidence-locked candidate）\n来源：82985fccb036d425435961e9c50b4d6890664169\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第二十九→三十回\n权限：L4 may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：对象特异关系 → 冲突/断开 → 现实重入请求 → 对方仍保留接纳资格 → 双方回应 → 修复并恢复共同接近。\n\n母分支：断开强度 / 重入资格 / 发起拓扑 / 修复深度 / 自由性 / 第三方依赖。\n护栏：感情深 / 舍不得 / 哭得厉害 / 命中注定 ≠ nz；关键是对象特异 + bilateral reentry + repair。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1020,"width":560,"height":500,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜nz 冲突修复型发散镜像\n检查范围：63883d7… → 82985fc…\n来源：c779776… 火轴总纲同步（无新机制）；82985fcc… 宝黛冲突修复 pure-nz positive control。\n新变量：relation-specific reentry eligibility / repair capacity / bilateral response / repair depth / third-factor dependence。\n新增：nz → conflict-repair-and-real-reentry。\n验证：nearest-neighbor 分账 z/x/n/nx；removal/reverse。\n下一断点：same window + same object layer 的 xz/nz 共现；其它单十元母分支。"},{"id":"generator_contract_20260905","type":"text","x":1040,"y":980,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## 应用层｜trigger registry ↔ compiler 契约硬门\n来源：770fafb8725fc49f72e9f5308a93485c6c208360 + d354f9da292884094d5c25600fa4b86a2c891008\n状态：真实代码+测试已提交；完整 runtime suite 仍不得冒充已通过\n\nchanged_variable：运行时 canonical token 集与 parser_version 一致性。\n约束：CANONICAL 必须导出、不得重复、与 registry 完全一致；PARSER_VERSION 必须一致；漂移 fail closed。\n测试：缺 token / 重复 token / parser version 漂移。\n意义：下游应用不能维护第二套 token 真相；不是新 canonical。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1933_generator_contract","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1580,"width":570,"height":470,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜生成器 compiler-registry 契约镜像\n来源：770fafb… + d354f9da…\n解决：把 trigger_registry ↔ compiler fail-closed 契约画入应用层，不误写十元语义。\n修改：repo_preflight_v0.1.js / .test.js。\n新变量：runtime canonical token-set consistency / parser_version consistency。\n验证：缺 token、重复 token、版本漂移明确失败。\n拒绝：应用 token 列表作为新 canonical；测试数量冒充完整 runtime PASS。"},{"id":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1780,"width":560,"height":560,"text":"## x｜protected-range 风险拓扑 / current-window 发散（L4 evidence-locked，may_override_canonical=false）\n来源：36dd5ff544a13e77378a4f8f1a9e54c63fa44dc5 + 6480461b6ac71fbf4fa188ca4d8f2697e9f0f96d\n\nchanged_variable：risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window。\n母分支：未通过当前 risk-test；已验证 ON 后拓扑改变可 OFF；underlying x 与 protected-range 状态分离；不同 risk channel/path 分账；repair/re-enabled 后须重新现实测试。\nWorld War Z：topology A verified ON → vertical aggregation topology B → breach/OFF。\nThe Purge：boundary ON/armed/re-enabled ≠ stable protected-range ON。\n状态：effective dynamic = 2 controls / 2 works；不自动扩 canonical。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2034_xprotected","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2110,"width":590,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x protected-range topology 动态镜像\n来源：36dd5ff… + 6480461b…\n解决：从静态边界推进为 risk-topology + current-window 动态，并加 re-enabled≠protection restored 护栏。\n新变量：risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window / boundary_state / tested_protection_state。\n拒绝：underlying management x 仍在就假定保护 ON；broad risk 名称没变就外推旧 PASS。\n下一断点：repair 后 same actor/boundary/risk channel 的真实复测。"},{"id":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":2420,"width":580,"height":610,"text":"## xz × nz｜伪同层共现护栏（L4 candidate / deferred）\n来源：6103099920cee0c614b5fca8c16bb01ca7725540\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第96–98回\n权限：may_override_canonical=false\n\n硬门：same characters + same current window + same broad relation label ≠ same object layer。\nxz 候选测婚配处置路径/结果空间收窄；nz 测对象特异、自由、现实 bilateral reentry/repair。\n组合前必须对齐 actor + object + changed_variable + reality_anchor。\nremoval/reverse 表明两端可独立变化。\n状态：strict_xz_nz=false；deferred guard，不增加 evidence-locked control/work。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2232_water_guard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2730,"width":600,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜xz×nz 伪同层共现护栏镜像\n来源：67198a3… 状态纠偏 + 610309992… 宝黛 false-same-layer guard。\n新变量：object_layer / changed_variable / reality_anchor / current-window cooccurrence validity。\n拒绝：same characters + same window + broad relation label 直接视为同层共现。\n验证：nearest-neighbor、removal、reverse 均显示可独立变化。\n下一断点：真正 same actor + same window + same object + same changed_variable 的 xz+nz。"},{"id":"x_strict_precondition_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":380,"y":3090,"width":620,"height":610,"text":"## x｜strict-v2 归因 / 前置条件护栏（L4 pending-review ledger mirror）\n来源：d5b4a4bee27df23f494691e1008f8ace5513ee1f\n权限：may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：subject-specific x attribution / stable effect / independent purpose-anchor。\n护栏：保护结果成功 ≠ 主体 stable protected-range x；ordinary self-agency ≠ x；一次现实 effect ≠ stable x；true zn + true x + sole final gate 仍不自动 strict，若 x 有独立用途/排序 anchor 则 zn→x 可失败。\n检查：结果由谁的 path-set 造成；移除第三方后 x 是否仍成立；object 是否外部独立；effect 是否持续；移除 zn 后 x 是否有独立用途。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0033_xstrictguard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":3360,"width":620,"height":570,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜x strict-v2 归因护栏镜像\n来源：d5b4a4bee27df23f494691e1008f8ace5513ee1f\n解决：把 strict-v2 ledger 状态纠偏转译为 x 发散/验证负向护栏，不冒充 canonical。\n新变量：subject-specific attribution / endpoint ownership / stable effect / independent purpose-anchor。\n修正：Hotel Rwanda 结果≠Paul protected-range x；Thomas More ordinary self-agency≠x；Matt King competing-purpose anchor；Antigone 一次 effect≠stable x。\n下一断点：其它单十元可执行母分支。"},{"id":"generator_resolved_request_stability_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":1280,"width":480,"height":430,"text":"## 应用层｜resolved_request 模块 provenance 稳定化\n来源：d8e1e3e43a6cb94bd00cf3513f4c7be7a75666c8 + b72be3da7ec768459aab21f795059ec931d501f6\n状态：真实代码+测试已提交；不等于完整 runtime suite PASS\n\nchanged_variable：locked_modules / reroll_modules 的规范化与复现性。\n\n新增执行约束：\n- module 名称 NFKC + trim\n- 去空项、去重复\n- 按 ALL_MODULES 固定顺序排序\n- 未知模块排在已知模块之后并稳定排序\n- 不修改调用方原数组\n- 语义等价的模块集合应得到一致 resolved_request\n\n专项：测试明确使用 x并z少女，要求 canonical_symbols=['x并z']，因此 provenance 稳定化不得破坏 x并z 原子性。\n\n意义：同 seed/version/subject 下，不再因 locked/reroll 数组输入顺序或重复项制造伪差异；这是应用端可复现性硬门，不是十元语义。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0130_generator_provenance","type":"text","x":1510,"y":3990,"width":620,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜生成器 resolved_request provenance 镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：d5b4a4bee… → b72be3da…（中间 13496c4 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把生成器 P0-3 的模块 provenance 稳定化镜像到应用执行层/验证层，避免把语义等价请求误当成不同发散输入。\n\n来源提交：\n- d8e1e3e43a6cb94bd00cf3513f4c7be7a75666c8：新增 normalizeModuleList，并接入 locked_modules / reroll_modules\n- b72be3da7ec768459aab21f795059ec931d501f6：新增 5 个 resolved_request stability cases\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_v0.1.js\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/resolved_request_stability_v0.1.test.js\n\n新变量：module-list normalization / dedupe / canonical order / request reproducibility / input immutability。\n新增分支：应用端 resolved_request provenance stability。\n验证：5 个针对性测试覆盖 locked 顺序、reroll 去重、NFKC+trim、等价请求 deepEqual、调用方数组不变；x并z 专项保持原子 token。\n拒绝：把这些测试冒充完整 P0 runtime PASS；把应用 provenance 规则写成十元 canonical。\n\n下一断点：优先镜像新的单十元可执行语法；应用端只继续镜像会直接影响发散输入等价性、锁定/重抽稳定性、可复现性的真实变化。"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_input_lock","fromNode":"input","toNode":"lock_problem","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_lock_var","fromNode":"lock_problem","toNode":"find_variable","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_var_core","fromNode":"find_variable","toNode":"core","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_single","fromNode":"core","toNode":"single_deep","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_horizontal","fromNode":"core","toNode":"horizontal","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_single_combine","fromNode":"single_deep","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_horizontal_combine","fromNode":"horizontal","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_combine_verify","fromNode":"combine","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_verify_output","fromNode":"verify","toNode":"outputs","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_rule_core","fromNode":"rule","toNode":"core","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_z","fromNode":"core","toNode":"z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_n","fromNode":"core","toNode":"n","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xpz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x_parallel_z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_x","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_protocol_runlog","fromNode":"automation_protocol","toNode":"runlog","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_runlog_core","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"core","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_output_assets","fromNode":"outputs","toNode":"assets","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_x_pending","fromNode":"x","toNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_x_pending_verify","fromNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"right","toSide":"bottom"},{"id":"e_runlog_20260905","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_xscope","fromNode":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","toNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_nz_conflict_repair","fromNode":"nz","toNode":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_nz_conflict_verify","fromNode":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"right","toSide":"bottom"},{"id":"e_runlog_nzrepair","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","f